  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Witching Hourglass procs on direct damage and healing spells (#13090)",
  "contract": [
    "#13090: Witching Hourglass (proc dummies 5011142, 5011143, 5011144, 5011145, 5011146, 5011147, 5011148,",
    "5011149, 5011150, 5011151, 5011152, 5012142, 5012143, 5012144, 5012145, 5012146, 5012147, 5012148, 5012149,",
    "5012150, 5012151, 5012152) never procced. Every dummy carries Spell.dbc ProcFlags 0 and the world had no",
    "spell_proc row, so SpellMgr::LoadSpellProcs skipped it. Tooltip: \"Your direct damage and healing spells ...",
    "(45 sec cd)\". Flags 81920 (harmful and helpful magic spells) as the stock records with that wording, damage",
    "and heals. Chance from each record (100 on the heroic dungeon copies, 15 on the level 70 copies), by the PR",
    "author's ruling. spell_proc_chance reads each loaded entry's chance, which equals the record's ProcChance,",
    "and spell_proc_cooldown_ms reads each loaded cooldown. aura_proc_rate replays the aura's native proc",
    "decision, including the roll, 40000 times on one synthetic event per check. It procs on a landed direct",
    "magic spell (Frostbolt 116), a direct heal (Flash Heal 2061), at the record's chance; it never procs on a",
    "heal over time tick (Rejuvenation 774), a periodic Shadow tick (Shadow Word: Pain 589), a landed melee",
    "ability (Heroic Strike 78). Before the repair the chance and cooldown lookups fail with 'Spell has no proc",
    "entry' and every rate reads 0, so the discriminating checks fail instead of flaking."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 60000,
